			text = [=[Astranaar is the chief town of the night elves in {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link}. It stands on an island in a lake at the heart of the forest, joined to the shore by bridges of white stone. Here {link:raene-wolfrunner}Raene Wolfrunner{/link} commands the {link:sentinels}Sentinels{/link} of the region, and from here scouts ride to every corner of the forest. The town has an inn, a hippogryph roost and a little market of elven craftsmen. It has also become a house of worry. Its sentinels report the furbolgs growing in number to the north, a child lies sick in one of its homes, and the war with the {link:horde}Horde{/link} draws closer to its bridges every season.]=],
		},
