			text = [=[Ordil'Aran is a broken town of the ancient elves in northern {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link}, north-east of {link:maestra-s-post}Maestra's Post{/link}. Its name recalls the twin towns of {link:ameth-aran}Ameth'Aran{/link} and {link:bashal-aran}Bashal'Aran{/link} in {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}, which were built for the Highborne in the days of {link:queen-azshara}Queen Azshara{/link}. Now the warlocks of the {link:cult-of-the-dark-strand}Cult of the Dark Strand{/link} dig among its stones. One of them carried a soul gem that held the secret of the cult's power, until {link:delgren-the-purifier}Delgren the Purifier{/link} sent a champion to take it.]=],
