			text = [=[The Howling Vale lies in the north of {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link}, near the border of {link:felwood}Felwood{/link}. Its heart is the ruined shrine of Mel'Thandris, where a strange tome is kept. Mel'Thandris herself blessed its pages, and by a power none can explain they set down the great events of the land. Of late, wolf-men have taken the shrine. Their chilling calls gave the vale its name. The tome showed the {link:sentinels}Sentinels{/link} that these creatures are bound to a priestess who vanished, and to a relic called the {red:scythe-of-elune}Scythe of Elune{/red}.]=],
		},
	},
})

