			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Splintertree Post is the {link:horde}Horde{/link}'s stronghold in eastern {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link}, a walled camp of orcish huts on a hill above the road to the {link:the-barrens}Barrens{/link}. It guards the Warsong lumber camps and the roads that carry their timber south. Its warriors, hunters and traders come from every people of the Horde. {link:mastok-wrilehiss}Mastok Wrilehiss{/link} grumbles at its gate, {link:senani-thunderheart}Senani Thunderheart{/link} sets the young hunters their tests, and {link:ertog-ragetusk}Ertog Ragetusk{/link} plans the raids against the elves. Few nights pass there without an alarm.]=],
