			title = "Summary",
			text = [=[Demon Fall Canyon is a deep gorge in south-eastern {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link}, and its name remembers the most famous deed of the {link:third-war}Third War{/link}. In a canyon of this forest, {link:grom-hellscream}Grom Hellscream{/link} drove his axe into the pit lord {link:mannoroth}Mannoroth{/link} and freed the orcs from the demon's blood, and there he died. The canyon has not been cleansed. Felguards stand guard in it, infernals smolder among its rocks, and hounds of the Legion hunt on the ridge above. On Felfire Hill to the south, a dreadlord called Diathorus the Seeker commands them.]=],
