			text = [=[Raene Wolfrunner leads the {link:sentinels}Sentinels{/link} of {link:astranaar}Astranaar{/link}. She is a huntress who keeps a wolf and a great cat at her side, and every report from the forest passes through her hands. She sends for help as far as {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}, and those who answer find her calm, grave and very short of warriors.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Raene holds the heart of {link:ashenvale}Ashenvale{/link} for the night elves at a time when their enemies press from every side. Her war is fought on two fronts at once: against the {link:horde}Horde{/link}, and against the corruption that has turned the furbolgs of the forest into beasts.]=],
